@startuml
title API console - login once for later processes
actor Operator
participant "API console process" as CLI
participant ApiConsole as Command
participant SmurfsApiClient as Client
participant "Smurfs.API account endpoint" as API
participant ITokenStore as Store
Operator -> CLI : login (email / password-stdin options)
CLI -> Command : LoginAsync(options)
Command -> Operator : Read credentials (hidden password / explicit stdin)
Command -> Client : LoginAsync(email, password)
Client -> API : POST /api/account/login
alt valid credentials
  API --> Client : Account and token
  Client --> Command : ApiUser (display information)
  Command -> Client : GetAccessToken()
  Client --> Command : Secret token
  Command -> Store : Save(API address, token)
  Store --> Command : Saved in platform store (Windows / Linux)
  Command --> Operator : Account confirmation
  CLI --> Operator : Exit 0
else authentication or credential storage failed
  Command --> CLI : Exception
  CLI --> Operator : Error on stderr, exit 1 (no prompt loop)
end
@enduml
